3. PRODUCT VISION

MyBooks is a premium-feeling, offline-first personal digital library and document-reading application.

Users should be able to import their own books and documents, organize their library, read supported formats, save bookmarks, create notes, and resume reading from their last position.

The app also includes an optional online Community where users can discuss books using text and emojis and optionally share Google Drive links.

The core reader must not require an account, Firebase connection, or internet access.

Community features require internet access and authentication, but users must never be forced to sign in just to read their own local books.

